<title>USA: Tesoro says year end reserves increase.</title>
<headline>Tesoro says year end reserves increase.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tesoro Petroleum Corp said Monday its worldwide, proved reserves were 371 billion cubic feet equivalent, an increase of 82 percent from proved reserves at the end of 1995.</p>
<p>The company said its Exploration and Productio segment replaced 517 percent of its worldwide, 1996 production of 41 billion cubic feet equivalent.</p>
